  "title": "How to Slash Documentation Costs in 2025: Ambient AI Scribe Strategies for Mid-Market Specialty Practices",
  "summary": "In 2025, mid-market specialty practices are slashing documentation costs by 40–60% through ambient AI scribe technology that automates EHR-ready notes, reduces burnout, and improves billing accuracy. By strategically piloting AI in high-volume clinics, replacing human scribes, and leveraging smart coding and compliance tools, practices can boost efficiency and revenue without disrupting workflows.",
